---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Tags"
description: "Assuntos que aparecem por aqui."
label: "Tags"
permalink: /tags/
---
<article class="wrap page">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="label">Tags</p>
    <h1>Assuntos</h1>
    <p class="page-deck">Tudo o que já apareceu no blog, por tema.</p>
  </header>

  <ul class="tag-index">
    {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
      <li>
        <a href="/tags/{{ tag.slug }}/">
          <span>{{ tag.name }}</span>
          <span class="count">{{ tag.count }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</article>
